      <title>万米高空新机遇？迪拜航空全线拥抱星链，解锁机上互联新时代</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251118-%E4%B8%87%E7%B1%B3%E9%AB%98%E7%A9%BA%E6%96%B0%E6%9C%BA%E9%81%87%E8%BF%AA%E6%8B%9C%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E5%85%A8%E7%BA%BF%E6%8B%A5%E6%8A%B1%E6%98%9F%E9%93%BE%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E6%96%B0%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3/</link>
